{"id":"mahabharata-3-057","work":"mahabharata","part":3,"partName":"आरण्यकपर्व","partNameEn":"Aranyaka Parva","unit":57,"title":"सप्तपञ्चाशत्तमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 57 · Damayanti sends her children away","summary":{"en":"Seeing Nala lost in the game, Damayanti calls his ministers in vain, then sends their two children with the charioteer Varshneya to her father's house in Vidarbha. Varshneya then goes to serve King Rituparna of Ayodhya.","kn":"ಜೂಜಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಮುಳುಗಿದ ನಳನನ್ನು ಕಂಡು ದಮಯಂತಿ ಮಂತ್ರಿಗಳನ್ನು ವ್ಯರ್ಥವಾಗಿ ಕರೆಯುತ್ತಾಳೆ; ಅನಂತರ ಇಬ್ಬರು ಮಕ್ಕಳನ್ನು ಸಾರಥಿ ವಾರ್ಷ್ಣೇಯನೊಂದಿಗೆ ವಿದರ್ಭದ ತಂದೆಯ ಮನೆಗೆ ಕಳುಹಿಸುತ್ತಾಳೆ. ವಾರ್ಷ್ಣೇಯನು ಅಯೋಧ್ಯೆಯ ಋತುಪರ್ಣರಾಜನ ಸೇವೆಗೆ ಹೋಗುತ್ತಾನೆ.","hi":"नल को द्यूत में खोया देख दमयन्ती व्यर्थ ही मन्त्रियों को बुलाती हैं, फिर अपने दोनों बच्चों को सारथी वार्ष्णेय के साथ विदर्भ में पिता के घर भेज देती हैं। वार्ष्णेय फिर अयोध्या के राजा ऋतुपर्ण की सेवा में चला जाता है।","te":"జూదంలో మునిగిన నలుని చూసి దమయంతి మంత్రులను వ్యర్థంగా పిలుస్తుంది, తర్వాత ఇద్దరు పిల్లలను సారథి వార్ష్ణేయునితో విదర్భలోని తండ్రి ఇంటికి పంపుతుంది. వార్ష్ణేయుడు అయోధ్యరాజు ఋతుపర్ణుని కొలువులో చేరతాడు.","ta":"சூதில் மூழ்கிய நளனைக் கண்டு தமயந்தி அமைச்சர்களை வீணாக அழைக்கிறாள்; பின்னர் இரு குழந்தைகளையும் தேரோட்டி வார்ஷ்ணேயனுடன் விதர்பத்திலுள்ள தந்தை வீட்டுக்கு அனுப்புகிறாள். வார்ஷ்ணேயன் அயோத்தி மன்னன் ருதுபர்ணனிடம் பணிக்குச் செல்கிறான்.","ml":"ചൂതുകളിയിൽ നഷ്ടപ്പെട്ട നളനെ കണ്ട ദമയന്തി മന്ത്രിമാരെ വിളിക്കുന്നു, പക്ഷേ വ്യർത്ഥം; പിന്നെ അവരുടെ രണ്ടു മക്കളെ സാരഥി വാർഷ്ണേയനോടൊപ്പം വിദർഭയിലെ പിതൃഗൃഹത്തിലേക്ക് അയക്കുന്നു. വാർഷ്ണേയൻ അയോധ്യയിലെ ഋതുപർണ്ണരാജാവിനെ സേവിക്കാൻ പോകുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 3.57; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Mon Apr 11 2022","sections":[{"title":"इन्द्रलोकाभिगमनपर्व","titleEn":"Indralokabhigamana Parva (Journey to Indra's world)","verses":[{"text":"बृहदश्व उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Brihadashva said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"दमयन्ती ततो दृष्ट्वा पुण्यश्लोकं नराधिपम् ।\nउन्मत्तवदनुन्मत्ता देवने गतचेतसम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Damayanti, seeing the king of holy fame absorbed in gambling like one maddened, though not mad herself,"}},{"n":2,"text":"भयशोकसमाविष्टा राजन्भीमसुता ततः ।\nचिन्तयामास तत्कार्यं सुमहत्पार्थिवं प्रति ॥","meaning":{"en":"was seized by fear and grief, king, and Bhima's daughter thought about the great matter facing the king."}},{"n":3,"text":"सा शङ्कमाना तत्पापं चिकीर्षन्ती च तत्प्रियम् ।\nनलं च हृतसर्वस्वमुपलभ्येदमब्रवीत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Fearing that evil and wanting to do what was good for him, seeing Nala robbed of everything, she said:"}},{"n":4,"text":"बृहत्सेने व्रजामात्यानानाय्य नलशासनात् ।\nआचक्ष्व यद्धृतं द्रव्यमवशिष्टं च यद्वसु ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"Brihatsena, go, summon the ministers on Nala's order and tell them what property has been lost and what wealth remains.\""}},{"n":5,"text":"ततस्ते मन्त्रिणः सर्वे विज्ञाय नलशासनम् ।\nअपि नो भागधेयं स्यादित्युक्त्वा पुनराव्रजन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then all the ministers, learning of Nala's command, said \"May it be our fortune,\" and returned again."}},{"n":6,"text":"तास्तु सर्वाः प्रकृतयो द्वितीयं समुपस्थिताः ।\nन्यवेदयद्भीमसुता न च तत्प्रत्यनन्दत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bhima's daughter told her husband that all the subjects had come a second time, but he did not welcome it."}},{"n":7,"text":"वाक्यमप्रतिनन्दन्तं भर्तारमभिवीक्ष्य सा ।\nदमयन्ती पुनर्वेश्म व्रीडिता प्रविवेश ह ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing her husband not welcome her words, Damayanti, ashamed, went back into the house."}},{"n":8,"text":"निशम्य सततं चाक्षान्पुण्यश्लोकपराङ्मुखान् ।\nनलं च हृतसर्वस्वं धात्रीं पुनरुवाच ह ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hearing that the dice were constantly turned against the king of holy fame and that Nala had lost everything, she spoke again to her nurse."}},{"n":9,"text":"बृहत्सेने पुनर्गच्छ वार्ष्णेयं नलशासनात् ।\nसूतमानय कल्याणि महत्कार्यमुपस्थितम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"Brihatsena, go again, on Nala's order, and bring the charioteer Varshneya, good lady; a great matter has arisen.\""}},{"n":10,"text":"बृहत्सेना तु तच्छ्रुत्वा दमयन्त्याः प्रभाषितम् ।\nवार्ष्णेयमानयामास पुरुषैराप्तकारिभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hearing Damayanti's words, Brihatsena brought Varshneya through trustworthy men."}},{"n":11,"text":"वार्ष्णेयं तु ततो भैमी सान्त्वयञ्श्लक्ष्णया गिरा ।\nउवाच देशकालज्ञा प्राप्तकालमनिन्दिता ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Bhima's daughter, who knew the right place and time and was above reproach, comforted Varshneya with gentle words and said, since the time had come:"}},{"n":12,"text":"जानीषे त्वं यथा राजा सम्यग्वृत्तः सदा त्वयि ।\nतस्य त्वं विषमस्थस्य साहाय्यं कर्तुमर्हसि ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"You know how the king always treated you well. You should help him now that he is in distress."}},{"n":13,"text":"यथा यथा हि नृपतिः पुष्करेणेह जीयते ।\nतथा तथास्य द्यूते वै रागो भूयोऽभिवर्धते ॥","meaning":{"en":"The more King Pushkara beats him here, the more Nala's passion for the dice grows."}},{"n":14,"text":"यथा च पुष्करस्याक्षा वर्तन्ते वशवर्तिनः ।\nतथा विपर्ययश्चापि नलस्याक्षेषु दृश्यते ॥","meaning":{"en":"And as Pushkara's dice obey his will, so one sees Nala's dice turn against him."}},{"n":15,"text":"सुहृत्स्वजनवाक्यानि यथावन्न शृणोति च ।\nनूनं मन्ये न शेषोऽस्ति नैषधस्य महात्मनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"He does not listen as he should to the words of friends and kinsmen. I think nothing is left of the great Nishadha."}},{"n":16,"text":"यत्र मे वचनं राजा नाभिनन्दति मोहितः ।\nशरणं त्वां प्रपन्नास्मि सारथे कुरु मद्वचः ।\nन हि मे शुध्यते भावः कदाचिद्विनशेदिति ॥","meaning":{"en":"The king, deluded, does not welcome my words. I come to you for refuge, charioteer; do as I say. My heart is not at peace, lest he be ruined."}},{"n":17,"text":"नलस्य दयितानश्वान्योजयित्वा महाजवान् ।\nइदमारोप्य मिथुनं कुण्डिनं यातुमर्हसि ॥","meaning":{"en":"Yoke Nala's dear, very swift horses, place this pair of children in the chariot, and take them to Kundina."}},{"n":18,"text":"मम ज्ञातिषु निक्षिप्य दारकौ स्यन्दनं तथा ।\nअश्वांश्चैतान्यथाकामं वस वान्यत्र गच्छ वा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Leave the two children and the chariot with my relatives, and then, as you wish, stay there with the horses or go elsewhere.\""}},{"n":19,"text":"दमयन्त्यास्तु तद्वाक्यं वार्ष्णेयो नलसारथिः ।\nन्यवेदयदशेषेण नलामात्येषु मुख्यशः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Varshneya, Nala's charioteer, told Damayanti's words in full to Nala's chief ministers."}},{"n":20,"text":"तैः समेत्य विनिश्चित्य सोऽनुज्ञातो महीपते ।\nययौ मिथुनमारोप्य विदर्भांस्तेन वाहिना ॥","meaning":{"en":"After meeting with them and deciding, he was given leave, lord of earth, and went to Vidarbha with the twin children in that vehicle."}},{"n":21,"text":"हयांस्तत्र विनिक्षिप्य सूतो रथवरं च तम् ।\nइन्द्रसेनां च तां कन्यामिन्द्रसेनं च बालकम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"There the charioteer left the horses and that excellent chariot, and the girl Indrasena and the boy Indrasena."}},{"n":22,"text":"आमन्त्र्य भीमं राजानमार्तः शोचन्नलं नृपम् ।\nअटमानस्ततोऽयोध्यां जगाम नगरीं तदा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Taking leave of King Bhima, grieving and pained for King Nala, he then wandered to the city of Ayodhya."}},{"n":23,"text":"ऋतुपर्णं स राजानमुपतस्थे सुदुःखितः ।\nभृतिं चोपययौ तस्य सारथ्येन महीपते ॥","meaning":{"en":"In great sorrow he approached King Rituparna and entered his service as charioteer, lord of earth."}}]}]}